+	  translated 4 KiB window in the controller instead.
+
+	  This option does the same: ioremap() of those windows returns a
+	  cookie, and the arm64 MMIO accessors hand cookie accesses to the
+	  PCIe driver. Every MMIO access in the kernel gets one extra address
+	  compare. Mapping BARs to user space (sysfs resource files, /dev/mem)
+	  does not work with this option.
+
+	  Say Y on RTD129x A00/A01 boards such as the QNAP TS-328.
+
 config PCIE_ROCKCHIP_HOST
 	tristate "Rockchip PCIe controller (host mode)"
 	depends on ARCH_ROCKCHIP || COMPILE_TEST
